	(paper "A4")
	(lib_symbols)
	(text_box "INTERFACE NOTES:\n- SPI2 IOMUX, DMA\n- SPI3 GPIOMATRIX, NODMA\n- I2S1 GPIOMATRIX\n- I2S2 GPIOMATRIX\n- I2C0 GPIOMATRIX CSI and P4 to C5\n- I2C1 GPIOMATRIX External Interface\n- UART0 IOMUX DEBUG\n- UART1 IOMUX External Interface\n- UART2\n- UART3\n- UART4\n- I3C\n- PARLIO\n  - PSSI_PDCK (Parallel Data Clock) to parlio_tx_clk_pad_out\n  - PSSI_RDY (Ready / Flow Control) to \n  - PSSI_DE (Data Enable) to parlio_tx_data15_pad_out MSB\n  - PSSI_D0 through PSSI_D7 (8-bit Data Bus) to parlio_tx_data0_pad_out 0 to 7\n  Connect suitable pins to the PSSI/SPI header then setup pins with ESP32P4 signals\n- DSI (LCD)\n  - LCD Choice: CTP ST7701S FT5316 D310FPC9362 CST128 (MIPI 2 LANE)\n- SDIO\n  - HS Communication between the P4 and C5 (Slave)\n  - INT pin deddicated as interrupt from C5 to P4 (Not part of SDIO)\n\nSERIES TERMINATION\n- CSI, DSI, SDIO (near P4), UART0, UART1, NOT I2C\nSDIO\n- Array Series termination on SDIO DATA 0-3\n- Individual series termination on CLK, CMD\n- PU on the SDIO INT (Interrupt) pin (Open Drain)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
