	(text_box "PROJECT REQUIREMENTS/GOALS:\n- Provide link to WIFI to other connected MCUs/PCBs\n- Function as a simple server\n- High Speed connection to expansion PCBs (8Bit Serial)\n- High Speed USB connector\n\nSECONDARY GOALS:\n- Motor control through PWM pins\n- Camera streaming (MIPI 2LANE)\n- LCD with touch screen (MIPI 2LANE)\n"
